  "description": "Minhyuk, an office worker who lives for listening to indie music, witnesses a group assault in a nearby alley after a show. Unable to stand by, he intervenes with his fists and breaks up the attack, only to be told by the victim that because of his interference the victim can no longer press charges. The victim begs Minhyuk to do him a favor instead. Reluctantly, Minhyuk agrees and moves on with his life, until one day he receives a message from that same victim.\n\n*“Can you just let me sleep at your place until I find somewhere to live?”*\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://bomtoon.com/detail/indi_blue)",
